A component which compares two code snippets.

Official component guide: https://axuj.github.io/magicui-solid/docs/components/code-comparison/. Component source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/axuj/magicui-solid/3100c2f704620f96dc431dd86f86bbbf9bb05965/src/registry/magicui/code-comparison.tsx.

Source-pinned component props:
